   "widgets_values": [
    "Wan 2.1 image-to-video on a 10 GB GPU (folders inside your ComfyUI folder):\n- models/diffusion_models/Wan2_1-I2V-ATI-14B_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors  (Kijai/WanVideo_comfy; any Wan 2.1 I2V 14B fp8 works)\n- models/loras/Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors  (CausVid, Kijai/WanVideo_comfy): 6 steps at cfg 1\n- models/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors  (Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged)\n- models/clip_vision/clip_vision_h.safetensors  (Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged)\n- models/vae/Wan2_1_VAE_fp32.safetensors  (Kijai/WanVideo_comfy; wan_2.1_vae also works)\nLow VRAM: start ComfyUI with --lowvram, keep 832x480 and 65 frames."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "Note: 0 · Wan 2.1 models"
